{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一名持雙程證男子，涉嫌在滙豐銀行使用偽鈔被捕。</p><p></p><p>該名70歲內地男子被警員帶走。</p><p></p><p>事發在下午近一時，警方接獲中環國際金融中心二期滙豐銀行職員報案，指一名男子要求開戶，並存入7張一千元港幣現鈔，但懷疑是偽鈔。經初步調查後，以涉嫌「使用偽鈔」將他拘捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T08:39:41.424683+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T08:57:46.214386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T08:37:38.312485+00:00","content_hash":"0a728062c9ba1a738c3e1de027b0dfc7e9594db0cf89ca7c831254c506a8f384","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}